synopsis: Lenient `Capture'` now passes `Either Text` to the handler, like the other lenient combinators
packages: servant-server
issues: #1118

description: {
The `Lenient` modifier is documented to wrap the argument in `Either Text`, and
`ReqBody'`, `QueryParam'` and `Header'` already do so. `Capture'` was the
exception: a handler for `Capture' '[Lenient] "name" a` received
`Either String a`. It now receives `Either Text a`.

This is a breaking change for handlers of lenient captures. To migrate, change
the argument type from `Either String a` to `Either Text a`, and use
`Data.Text.unpack` on the error if you need a `String`.
}
